---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'June 16, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility | DriveClean LI"
  description="DriveClean LI accessibility statement and how to request assistance."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-red-600">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
      Accessibility Statement
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose-policy mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Our commitment</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          DriveClean Mobile Detailing is committed to making drivecleanli.com accessible to as many
          people as possible. We aim to follow widely recognized accessibility practices, including
          the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA where practical.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Measures we take</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Semantic HTML structure for headings, landmarks, and forms</li>
          <li>Keyboard-accessible navigation and interactive controls where possible</li>
          <li>Visible focus states and sufficient color contrast on primary content</li>
          <li>Text alternatives for meaningful images and icons</li>
          <li>Form labels, error messages, and instructions on the booking flow</li>
          <li>Support for reduced-motion preferences in animations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Booking assistance</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          If you have difficulty completing a booking online, we are happy to help you schedule by
          phone or email. We can walk you through service options, availability, and payment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Known limitations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Some third-party tools used on our site — including payment checkout (Square) and address
          autocomplete (Google) — are controlled by external providers and may not fully meet the
          same accessibility standards as our own pages. We continue to review our booking
          experience and welcome feedback on areas that need improvement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Feedback</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          If you encounter a barrier on our website or have suggestions for improvement, please
          contact us. We will do our best to respond promptly and work toward a reasonable
          accommodation or fix.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <li>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:services@drivecleanli.com" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">
              services@drivecleanli.com
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            Phone:
            <a href="tel:+16317645337" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">(631) 764-5337</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <nav class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm font-medium" aria-label="Related pages">
      <a href="/privacy" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">← Back to home</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</Layout>
